{"productId": "e526f3c9-fec9-4682-a8aa-f3c153f60ccf", "modelName": "BAR MK 4 DBM", "modelDescription": "The roots of the Browning BAR run deep, tracing its history back to John M. Browning's original design for the U.S. military during the First World War. These legendary firearms earned an amazing service record, being used even into the early days of the Vietnam War. The sporting BAR has a contemporary design that offers shooters and hunters a lightweight semi-automatic rifle with refinements not present in the most popular modern sporting rifles, including a short-stroke gas-piston design. The BAR MK 4 DBM customizes the BAR design with a detachable box 10-round magazine and magazine well instead of the standard hinged floor plate design. The composite stock features overmolded gripping surfaces and a raised SoftFlex cheekpad, giving hunters every advantage in the field. A fluted barrel provides an excellent combination of lightweight design and exceptional accuracy. The alloy receiver is built with an integrated Picatinny rail for mounting optics. ", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "31b8cf87-0e08-4b77-a545-b9d9176e712e", "description": "Browning, BAR MK 4 DBM, Semi Automatic, 308 Winchester, 18.5\" Barrel, Matte Black Finish, Mossy Oak Bottomland Composite Stock, Right Hand, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/8172db70-1cde-47b0-b282-3e470022196a", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/71acfd02-3e20-4432-b94e-c73820c67ff4"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "039034218", "upc": "023614867791", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "5d7cb225-7607-4efe-ad2f-d56197e694de", "attributeName": "Adjustable Stock", "attributeValueId": "f3810c6c-d0fc-424a-81ad-cfaf1f11ff2f", "valueName": "No"}, {"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "39dc6a1d-d7e5-4a16-8623-2608